☐ Independent Salesforce admin tested before change
☐ Salesforce Login Form remains enabled
☐ CyberArk POC role created and limited to test identities
☐ Passkey enrollment tested before Salesforce integration
☐ CyberArk IdP metadata exported
☐ Salesforce POC SSO record created without altering existing production SSO
☐ Salesforce SP metadata / Entity ID / ACS captured
☐ CyberArk Trust values populated from Salesforce metadata
☐ NameID mapping validated for Jaime
☐ AMR/ACR signal verified as dynamic and phishing-resistant
